    "pdp_purpose_VdexGC": {
      "type": "pdp-purpose",
      "name": "PDP Purpose",
      "settings": {
        "design_preset": "inserts",
        "headline_poppins": true,
        "space_above_desktop": 0,
        "space_above_mobile": 0,
        "padding_top": 0,
        "padding_bottom": 0,
        "padding_top_mobile": 0,
        "padding_bottom_mobile": 0,
        "heading_line_1": "",
        "heading_line_2": "",
        "heading_line_3": "",
        "heading_line_4": "",
        "body": "",
        "point_1_title": "Patented Stay-Put Technology",
        "point_1_body": "<p>Turns out everyone else had the grip backwards. Our patented exterior-facing grippy-dot design holds onto fabric—not your skin—to help prevent shifting, sliding, and bunching all day long.</p>",
        "point_2_title": "Raising The Bar",
        "point_2_body": "<p>You deserve better than products that constantly let you down. That's why we listen closely to our community, rigorously test on real women's bodies, and continuously innovate to create solutions that prioritize both comfort and function.</p>",
        "point_3_title": "Easy All-Day Wear",
        "point_3_body": "<p>What's the point of bra inserts or breast forms if you can't wait to take them off? Honey Cloudz are cloud-soft, lightweight, and thoughtfully designed for all-day comfort, so you can spend less time thinking about what's inside your bra and more time feeling like yourself.</p>",
        "point_4_title": "Water, Sweat, & Chlorine Safe",
        "point_4_body": "<p>Life doesn't stop when you head to the pool or break a sweat. Honey Cloudz are designed to keep up with you through beach days, workouts, vacations, and everything in between—without compromising comfort or confidence.</p>",
        "mf_benefit_section_image_alt": ""
      }
    },
    "testimonials_carousel_Lm9Cn9": {
      "type": "testimonials-carousel",
      "blocks": {
        "review_WRKrTb": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/0b04c718b6e1c66a8fb51f85ed7c194c3075b314.png",
            "image_url": "",
            "stars": 5,
            "title": "“I am confident wearing them”",
            "text": "\"The quality of the Honey Cloudz performance oval breast forms is exceptional. They are lightweight and feel soft and comfortable post-mastectomy. Most importantly, they look and feel very natural, and I am confident wearing them. Lovely packaging with illustrations on how to wear and care for the forms. I was so impressed with this product that I ordered another set. I had a question about my order, and the customer service representative was incredibly helpful and friendly. She resolved my issue quickly and efficiently. Her service was truly outstanding. I highly recommend Honey Cloudz breast forms and will be a repeat customer!\"",
            "name": "Lynda K."
          }
        },
        "review_iFrV3K": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/45f5320c3787e6faf036e790d2bfe52cf16dad91.png",
            "image_url": "",
            "stars": 5,
            "title": "“My clothes look great and I feel like a woman again”",
            "text": "“Before Honey Cloudz as you can see my stomach stuck out more than my chest due to the mastectomy. After getting my Honey Cloudz my clothes look great and I feel like a woman again. Going through breast cancer and a bi-lateral mastectomy is difficult. Honey Cloudz gave me back my confidence. They are so light and comfortable. Thank you from the bottom of my heart Honey Cloudz.”",
            "name": "Rosemary S."
          }
        },
        "review_9ij8b4": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/69fcf2c63151bd973656bbc440129d36d129be3a.png",
            "image_url": "",
            "stars": 5,
            "title": "“It’s very similar to the shape I was before surgery”",
            "text": "“I had a double mastectomy on Feb 3. Due to complications reconstruction was put on hold so I’m currently flat. I’ve ordered both of the recommended products for mastectomy without reconstruction. The teardrop shape was good but the oval shape fits me GREAT! It’s very similar to the shape I was before surgery. I just want to say thank you for providing a product that is affordable and makes me feel good about how I look especially with spring/summer coming up!”",
            "name": "Stacy N."
          }
        },
        "review_RRyywq": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/97735aff72f77d60ca2e385b7af23e801eaccaf9.png",
            "image_url": "",
            "stars": 5,
            "title": "“They look so natural!”",
            "text": "“I teach fitness classes and have always been self conscious about my different sizes. I know it's pretty normal but it still bothers me! I was so happy to find these. I wear just one on the smaller side. I am able to teach yoga or cycling and feel so much better. It looks very natural and stays in place very well. I wash by hand in the sink and let it dry overnight.”",
            "name": "Tracy C."
          }
        },
        "review_Mx4tqy": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/08a9c9278527e479a97dae2aead8276f66f653ff.png",
            "image_url": "",
            "stars": 5,
            "title": "“I love Honey Cloudz!”",
            "text": "“I had a bi lateral mastectomy in 2014, followed by a failed reconstruction, fat transfer surgery. I have tried many breast prostheses/inserts and, so far Honey Cloudz are the most comfortable. I have found that they work best in a mastectomy bra that has the pockets. I love Honey Cloudz!”",
            "name": "Deborah V."
          }
        },
        "review_qAkqcc": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/61166f4a28a3f91a1b52e1e06a8b97f04d7920b1.png",
            "image_url": "",
            "stars": 5,
            "title": "“I use them all day and they don't shift.”",
            "text": "“I absolute love these! I bought the Ovals for masectomy and I found the perfect size. They fit in my old bras and I use them all day and they don't shift. You couldn't tell they were foobs! I have 3 sets now. A must for those looking for a natural light weight, pool safe, non irritating option.”",
            "name": "Erika D."
          }
        },
        "review_G4tQhn": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/f6a2fc0438ac87fe9215cb35fd247ee1909e5c0f.png",
            "image_url": "",
            "stars": 5,
            "title": "“These check all the boxes for me! I am super happy with them”",
            "text": "“After going through a double mastectomy, I decided not to have reconstruction. I was looking for a lightweight form that I could be active in and most importantly looked natural. These check all the boxes for me! I am super happy with them. I purchased 4 forms, to have an alternate set to switch with. So far I have worn them in a swimsuit, mastectomy bras and a sports bra. They work great in the pockets. Will be buying more!”",
            "name": "Kimberly R."
          }
        },
        "review_fc73NH": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/0b9970bc2a93c0c84bfc5d923ea0ac98a5126c29.png",
            "image_url": "",
            "stars": 5,
            "title": "“They met and exceeded all my expectations”",
            "text": "“I have finally found my happy place with these breast forms they met and exceeded all my expectations..I have been singing their praises, if you're on the fence, I highly recommend giving these a try..you won't regret it. Thank you Honey Cloudz!”",
            "name": "Jackie"
          }
        },
        "review_c7Qmn8": {
          "type": "review",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/8cc0217a4457f2349b2b2fb33404c92f3e19c1c6.png",
            "image_url": "",
            "stars": 5,
            "title": "“They stay in place without being the heavy”",
            "text": "\"I am post double mastectomy and purchased 2 of these oval breast forms. I am not sure if I will get reconstruction. I liked the idea of lightweight forms and the big plus that they stay in place without being the heavy all silicone kind. These are wonderful! They look very natural in everything I've tried them in. Really happy with them and the confidence boost.\"",
            "name": "Pam Y."
          }
        }
      },
